{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_06",
  "title": "10:26P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8dd79e16d9c6c8cbcccd565e6851f32b1ef7457df9ea2edc3883f805680b451b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:26 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nSunset Boulevard, 'The Ends of the Earth' lounge"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Say baws, what year's this vintage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hmm, maderized coloring, lively aroma, robust flavor, velvety texture, this is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Last month. A forty of malt liquor from the corner store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Perfect scores up and down, baws! That's why they call ya Lungmen's self-proclaimed number one sow-mel-eer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "*Pfft* How many times do I gotta tell you? This is a reserve weapon. It ain't for drinking! Sora!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Okay, okay, here's your mouthwash."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Um... did ya mean to wash yer mouth with Yan huangjiu...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Alcohol is a disinfectant. There's industrial alcohol under the bar. That would do the trick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "S'all good. We got money so we might as well spend it. It's all in the process, y'know? Ain't the amount. It's the process of spending!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Everybody, the apple pie's ready! It's time to party!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Oooh~ Exusiai's homemade apple pie!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Bottoms up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "...so like, what exactly are we partying for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Huh? It's Bison's welcome party."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "...so like, where's Bison?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Um! I dunno!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Then pick another reason. We always got a reason to party."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...What are you guys doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Awright. Here's the guest of honor himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hey. Welcome to The Ends of the Earth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "You're late. That's three shots. Guest of honor drinks triple, but you can't drink. So that's nine sodas. Drink up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Why is it called The Ends of the Earth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(And the decor is so gaudy... And what's with the penguin... is this some kind of punk thing...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Don't just stand there with your tongue hanging out. This is your welcome party! Apple pie?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...No thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So while me and Mostima were out there fighting off mobsters, you were in here partying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So... what happened to their leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "He got away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "To be more precise, we let him get away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Regardless, he got away... so what do we do next?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "We know the enemy's identity, their goal, and their numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "They're the Siracusan Mafia, and they wanted to take Penguin Logistics's territory in Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...even though we're a logistics firm and... never mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Don't sweat it, Texas. We've always got a few days here and there to take out the trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "When ya say it like that, it makes us sound even less like a legitimate business, don't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "They don't know what they're talking about. They couldn't fill the boss's t-shirt for two minutes without cracking under the pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Penguin Logistics is a unique operation. And I'm a step even more unique."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "But that means we have lots of options for how to work this out. Why do we have to fight with them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "You don't know? How have you been..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Alright, alright, let's not put too much brainpower into this. Find an opportunity to grab their boss, huck him in the river and boom, we're done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "This whole thing has been one big ass waste of time. I just. Don't. Give. A shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Seriously. This isn't really worth spending any more time on. Here, gum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Om..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "But we at least need to come up with a plan to... Wait, what flavor is this gum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "White Horse Kohl flavor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Croissant, please add this brand of gum to our hazardous materials list."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "We were runnin' low so I grabbed the new flavor. Didn't notice what it was. Oops."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Yo, are we gonna party or what? We got food, we got drinks, where's the tunes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "I'm on it~!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "I wasn't expecting jazz... even if it's a little..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "The previous owner was something of a jazz lover, but after the boss took over we had to make a few style changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "A few?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "It's pretty much because the boss's own records all got toasted in that——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Enough. Let's not bring back any tragic memories."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "And besides, nobody asked him to go get sick. Here I am takin' time outta my busy schedule to look after his bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "is it Oripathy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Lungmen's been through a lot. They should've changed the way they look at the Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Nah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "He picked up an alcohol allergy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "He was fixin' to be the greatest bartender in all Lungmen. Fer a feller like that, we call it terminal."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "We got some party crashers. Yo, get behind the bar if you wanna live."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Yessir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Nice! There's a coin back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Don't squirm around, there's not much room back here——Ow! Watch your halo, Exusiai!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Stop gawking and get down, Bison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Huh? Ah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get 'em!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Welp, that's the end of this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Mr. Emperor's still out there. Will he be okay?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Why are these punks still up in my business? Shoot back already, before they completely trash the joint!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Sorry, boss, I'm all out of rubber bullets. Should we go at them with the barstools?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Did I not buy a forty of malt liquor and leave it here for just such an occasion?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Um, we just drank the last bottle. All we got left is the top shelf stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Use it. I ain't some stuffy old rich man, filling my palaces with fancy show-off booze."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Let this liquor show us what it's worth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Huh? But the price on this stuff's higher than——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Grab it, hold it in your hand, and remember: aim for the head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Protecting this bar means protecting my land. Come on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Exusiai."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Got it! Take a bottle and smash a head. No problem!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "W- wait for me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're charging, watch out! Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "That's a hundred thousand. Hundred and fifty thousand. Four hundred and fifty thousand. Seven hundred thousand..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "How much was that one? No! Exusiai! Not that one—— agh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "What's... huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Tonight's property damage bill. At least you and I got our shields to fight with. Don't want that number gettin' any bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "R- right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Okay~ Three, two, one, go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
